function useAbility(which){if(state!=='playing'||paused||!player.alive||phase!=='live'||abilities[which]<=0||abilityCooldown[which]>0)return;if(which==='heal'){if(player.hp>=100){notify('生命值已满');return}player.hp=Math.min(100,player.hp+60);abilities.heal--;abilityCooldown.heal=1;tone(500,.4,'sine',.14,1000);notify('恢复 60 点生命值');particles(V(player.x,1,player.z),0xc5f46b,20,1,.7)}else if(which==='dash'){abilities.dash--;abilityCooldown.dash=2;let dx=-Math.sin(player.yaw),dz=-Math.cos(player.yaw);const side=(keys.has('KeyD')?1:0)-(keys.has('KeyA')?1:0);if(side){dx=Math.cos(player.yaw)*side;dz=-Math.sin(player.yaw)*side}for(let i=0;i<24;i++)moveEntity(player,dx*.3,dz*.3);noise(.24,.22,1200);particles(V(player.x,1,player.z),0xc5f46b,12,1,.4)}else{abilities.smoke--;abilityCooldown.smoke=1;const dir=camera.getWorldDirection(V());raycaster.set(V(player.x,1.5,player.z),dir);raycaster.far=13;const hit=raycaster.intersectObjects(wallMeshes,false)[0];const pos=V(player.x,1.6,player.z).addScaledVector(dir,hit?Math.max(1,hit.distance-1.5):11);pos.y=1.8;const m=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(3.1,1),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xa5b2ba,transparent:true,opacity:.94,roughness:1,flatShading:true}));m.position.copy(pos);scene.add(m);smokes.push({mesh:m,life:12,radius:3.1});noise(.5,.2,800);notify('烟雾已部署 · 12 秒')}updateHUD()}
